{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06902","headline":"句 · 王昌龄","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝荐抱良策，独倚江城楼。\n昨从金陵邑，远谪沅溪滨。\n娟魄已三孕。\n驾幸温泉日，严霜子月初。\n长亭酒未醒，千里风动地。\n苍荻寒沧江，石头岸边饮。\n天仗森森练雪凝，身骑铁骢自臂鹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}